	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 10th level, the first time you use @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.3jdfihvtbyhbv9ez]{Wild Shape} or @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.rug8vizQUS5ikaPT]{Nature’s Retaliation} in the presence of a sapient creature who would recognize you based on your Prestige, that target must make a Wisdom save against your Druid Spell DC or become [[/condition id=frightened]] for up to 1 minute. Frightened targets may make another save at the end of each of their turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
